test absolute positioning ignores the margins
spec VT510 DECOM: with origin mode reset the cursor can move outside the margins
size 10 4
feed \e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;9H
cursor 1,9

test wrapping goes from the right margin to the left margin
convention the right margin acts as the end of the line for autowrap
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
size 10 4
feed \e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;3Habcdef
screen
|  abcd|
|  ef|

test ICH shifts only up to the right margin
spec VT510 ICH: text between the cursor and the right margin moves right, characters past the right margin are lost
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
size 10 4
feed abcdefghij\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;3H\e[@
screen
|ab cdeghij|
cursor 1,3

test DCH shifts only up to the right margin
spec VT510 DCH: the remaining characters between the cursor and the right margin move left, blanks are added at the margin
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
size 10 4
feed abcdefghij\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;3H\e[P
screen
|abdef ghij|

test ICH outside the margins does nothing
spec VT510 ICH: no effect outside the scrolling margins
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
size 10 4
feed abcdefghij\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;1H\e[@
screen
|abcdefghij|

test DCH outside the margins does nothing
spec VT510 DCH: no effect outside the scrolling margins
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
size 10 4
feed abcdefghij\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;8H\e[P
