test insert mode shifts only up to the right margin
spec VT510 IRM: new characters move characters to the right; the right margin ends the scrolling region
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
size 10 4
feed abcdefghij\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;3H\e[4hX
screen
|abXcdeghij|

test IL moves only the columns between the margins
convention the scrolling region is the rectangle between the top, bottom, left and right margins (VT510 DECSLRM)
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
size 10 4
feed abcdefghij\r\nklmnopqrst\r\nuvwxyzABCD\r\nEFGHIJKLMN\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[2;3H\e[L
screen
|abcdefghij|
|kl    qrst|
|uvmnopABCD|
|EFwxyzKLMN|

test DL moves only the columns between the margins
