|abc|

test DECIC inserts columns inside the margins
spec VT510 DECIC: columns between the cursor and the right margin move right
known-fail: alacritty – DECLRMM (mode 69) is not supported: DECRQM answers 0 and CSI Pl ; Pr s sets no margins
