feed abcdefghij\r\nabcdefghij\r\nabcdefghij\r\nabcdefghij\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;3H\e[2'}
screen
|ab  cdghij|
|ab  cdghij|
|ab  cdghij|
|ab  cdghij|

test DECDC deletes columns inside the margins
