size 10 4
feed abcdefghij\r\nabcdefghij\r\nabcdefghij\r\nabcdefghij\e[?69h\e[3;6s\e[1;3H\e[2'~
screen
|abef  ghij|
|abef  ghij|
|abef  ghij|
|abef  ghij|

